# Target C — macroscopic harmonic cells carry linear exact fan populations

```text
actual small-matching / small-outer-excess source
 -> almost every loaded attachment is a degree-three good-fan vertex
 -> canonical pinned-incidence identity forces linear fan population in a macroscopic cell
 -> a finite source competitor or contradiction must act on that same cell and its ports.
The last source surgery/contradiction is not proved. Level I and C-II remain OPEN.
```

